{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Sünen-i Ebu Davud","section":{"38":"The Promised Deliverer (Kitab Al-Mahdi)"},"section_detail":{"38":{"hadithnumber_first":4279,"hadithnumber_last":4290,"arabicnumber_first":4279,"arabicnumber_last":4290,"name_native":"Vadedilen Kurtarıcı (Kitab Al-Mehdi)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4287,"arabicnumber":4287,"text":"Bize Harun b. Abdullah haber verdi, bize Hemmam'dan naklen Abdüssamed haber verdi. Hemmam'da katâde'den bu (4286 nolu) hadisi rivayet etti. Hemmam rivayetinde \"dokuz sene\" dedi","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":38,"hadith":9}}]}